ted on the deployment topology\n  investigation; if the selected topology differs from the working assumption,\n  the endpoint-linking scope is rewritten (the enabled-component display\n  remains).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42329,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f4f14a8699c610","agent_id":"a2075be10e54066c2","session_id":"c063278f-b757-405a-ad7d-6ea1f816e2d2","uuid":"2f9b5fe0-a728-4330-9957-835b2d2b83d8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:34:36.248Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9006"}
