t\n51\t  artifacts.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- The Feast server container image builds green in the Konflux build pipeline.\n56\t- The Feast SDK package builds from the midstream repository at a pinned,\n57\t  documented version.\n58\t- A pinned image digest for the productized Feast server image is available\n59\t  for downstream consumers to reference.\n60\t- The image and package satisfy productized-artifact requirements\n61\t  (non-root execution, provenance, documented version).\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- HLR-1 (P0): administrators get a supported Feature Store with productized\n66\t  images.\n67\t- HLR-2 (P1): the SDK package consumed by workbench images originates here.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcf2380e6a315fa1","agent_id":"ab39adcea040bb08b","session_id":"c063278f-b757-405a-ad7d-6ea1f816e2d2","uuid":"b432e4c3-e4ae-44a4-9006-1c80676d3e1b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:46:19.486Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-80985d61873a3ab2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9006 decomposition"}
